'''Cossack Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] who can be unlocked when beating [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Papuu's Paradise]] appearing on the '''3rd''', '''4th''', '''17th''' and '''18th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] increases health, damage, range and speed, and gains [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] targeting.

