==Trivia==
*Cossack Cat is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Cossacks|Cossack people]], while Royal Guard Cat is designed after the [[wikipedia:King's Guard|British Royal Guards]].
*The hat that Cossack and Vodka Cat wear is called a [[wikipedia:Papakha|Papakha]].
*His movement and attack animations are based on [[wikipedia:Hopak|Hopak]], more commonly known as the Cossack dance.
*In all 3 of his forms, Cossack Cat's attack animation is identical to his movement animation.

